  "description": "Choi Yu-Il is no stranger to misfortune. From losing his parents in a freak accident to suddenly presenting as a recessive omega in his twenties, bad things seem to follow him around. But through it all, his only friend Cha Hwan has stood proudly beside him. Hwan lets Yu-Il live with him, and when Yu-Il loses his job, Hwan even finds him a new one. The problem is…Hwan hates omegas. Terrified of losing the only person to ever stand by him, Yu-Il tries desperately to hide the truth. With his first heat fast-approaching, will Yu-Il be able to come to terms with the inevitable changes in their relationship…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes five side story chapters.*",
